    {
      "id": "resume-key-derivation",
      "description": "Resumed-session key derivation per §2.8.3. The HKDF input keying material is the concatenation of the fresh ephemeral shared secret and K_resumption recovered from the ticket. The salt and per-key info labels match the initial-handshake schedule (§2.1), so a fresh ephemeral DH is what preserves forward secrecy: an attacker holding the ticket alone cannot derive session keys.",
